  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1704909491_4686003_198ac6b9e6601f81d2c9cd305ce70a58.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);\">Brand Introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);\">Yoga Crow is a progressive performance clothing brand for men. With its roots squarely planted in the love for yoga as a way of life, Yoga Crow is made for men specializing in all forms of movement. The products are carefully crafted for maximum comfort, coolness and dryness during and after physical exertion and the ideal stretch and fit to move in sync with the body.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);\">We believe in the power of yoga to be a physically and spiritually transformative lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);\">Production Description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250);\">Our signature items are our Flow and Swerve shorts:</p>\r\n<p>Our Swerve shorts are made for movement: the ergonomic construction prevents the shorts from bunching up. The 4-way stretch performance fabric follows your every maneuver, and its moisture-wicking properties, along with the anti-microbial liner, keep you cool, fresh and dry during and after your routine.</p>\r\n<p>Our newest addition, the Flow short is shorter and slightly slimmer than the Swerve. We put a lot of detail into the design to make it lightweight, eco-friendly, and fast drying. With a water-repellent outer shell and laser cut holes across the back yoke for increased ventilation, the Flow Short lets you move freely while staying cool and dry during your workouts.</p>\r\n<p>Payment Options: 10% Off All Sales Generated, via PayPal</p>",
